778
00:31:54,320 --> 00:31:57,320
There are some negative results.

779
00:31:57,320 --> 00:32:01,320
But the evidence is that markets are remarkably efficient.

780
00:32:01,320 --> 00:32:04,320
And this is a truth that we've discovered.

