1184
00:49:04,760 --> 00:49:06,020
Because you have no bias.

1185
00:49:06,020 --> 00:49:08,080
He could go in any direction equally likely.

1186
00:49:08,080 --> 00:49:09,540
So, what's most likely?

1187
00:49:09,540 --> 00:49:12,260
It's that he stays right where he is.

1188
00:49:12,260 --> 00:49:15,160
And what is the probability distribution?

1189
00:49:15,160 --> 00:49:18,240
Well, it turns out that the standard deviation around that

1190
00:49:18,240 --> 00:49:21,200
